# title: Range accrual note
# category: Structured notes
# underlyings: 1
# source: Bouzoubaa & Osseiran, Exotic Options and Hybrids: A Guide to Structuring, Pricing and Trading, Wiley, 2010
# summary: Earns 8% a year on each day the stock closes between 90% and 110% of its initial level; capital protected.
#
# Notional 1000. Coupon at maturity = 8% x (days in range / days observed).

2027-01-04
    s0 = spot()
    inside = 0
    n = 0

schedule(2027-01-05, 2027-12-30, 1D, US, F)
    n = n + 1
    if spot() >= 0.90 * s0 and spot() <= 1.10 * s0 then inside = inside + 1 endIf

2028-01-04
    n = n + 1
    if spot() >= 0.90 * s0 and spot() <= 1.10 * s0 then inside = inside + 1 endIf
    pays 1000 * (1 + 0.08 * inside / n)
